# Advanced photo merge.
photo_merge_advanced.projective = Adwene a wɔde hwɛ ade a ɛne ne ho hyia (a nea ɛka ho ne nea wɔkyinkyini) .
photo_merge_advanced.cylindrical = Panorama a ɛyɛ kurukuruwa
photo_merge_advanced.deghost = Yi mfonini a ɛsan ba wɔ nneɛma a ɛrekeka wɔn ho mu (fa mfonini a edi kan no yɛ nhwɛso)
photo_merge_advanced.focal = Focal tenten (px) / mfonini no trɛw (px) .
photo_merge_advanced.masks = Focus output de layer masks a wotumi sesa di dwuma. Paw mask wɔ Layers mu na paint na fa siesie.
photo_merge_advanced.no_match = Wonhuu nhyiam biara a wotumi de ho to so. Fa mfonini ahorow a wɔakyerɛw so a ɛka bom kɛse na nsakrae kakraa bi wɔ sɛnea wohwɛ nneɛma mu di dwuma.
photo_merge_advanced.invalid = Mfonini ahorow a ɛnteɛ a efi fibea anaasɛ nhyehyɛe a wɔde ka bom.
